# First report of injury

[Jordan Rivera (Welder II)](#employee) was handling stock at the
[Bay 3 shear table](#location) when a [sheet-metal edge](#object) caused a
[laceration to the left hand](#nature) at [09:10 on 2026-01-12](#incident).
[Pressure dressing applied on site](#first-aid); employee transported to
Harborview Occupational Health. Reported by [M. Delgado](#reported-by).
The signed paper form is attached as a scan
([first-report-scan.pdf](first-report-scan.pdf)).

*No diagnosis is recorded here — clinical findings belong to the clinic's
chart (`example/patient`).*
